or I might have short-circuited.

108
00:06:29,540 --> 00:06:30,370
Thank you.

109
00:06:30,720 --> 00:06:31,602
You're welcome.

110
00:06:35,940 --> 00:06:39,277
And Kikuyu, we all want to say
happy birthday to you, too.

111
00:06:39,360 --> 00:06:40,240
Oh, wow.

112
00:06:40,480 --> 00:06:41,656
That's sweet of you.

113
00:06:42,240 --> 00:06:43,070
Oh, yeah.

114
00:06:43,153 --> 00:06:44,717
Kikuyu's birthday wasn't too long ago.

115
00:06:44,800 --> 00:06:46,447
It's a double birthday bash.

116
00:06:46,820 --> 00:06:48,400
That's twice as nice.

117
00:06:50,460 --> 00:06:55,677
thanks boxer we owe you true without
your assistance the origin stratum

118
