come for us to leave the dungeon.

196
00:11:13,440 --> 00:11:15,080
I thought that might be it.

197
00:11:15,320 --> 00:11:19,517
I hate leaving it all behind when this
place is still plagued by odd occurrences.

198
00:11:19,600 --> 00:11:21,247
I know it's awfully selfish.

199
00:11:22,080 --> 00:11:24,500
You're not selfish. You've helped a ton.

200
