208
00:11:50,300 --> 00:11:51,160
Hello there!

209
00:11:53,000 --> 00:11:55,797
It just occurred to me
this might be the last

210
00:11:55,880 --> 00:11:59,137
time we talk you know
the Nether Lord's power

211
00:11:59,220 --> 00:12:01,177
isn't enough not to get you two out of the

212
00:12:01,260 --> 00:12:04,757
dungeon please tell me you
have a plan I'll open a

213
00:12:04,840 --> 00:12:07,597
temporary path by
channeling my magic into a

214
00:12:07,680 --> 00:12:10,697
transfer circle Hula Me's
theory but there's no

215
00:12:10,780 --> 00:12:14,757
guarantee and it's risky
she's very much against

216
00:12:14,840 --> 00:12:17,777
the idea since it's quite
dangerous and may not work.

217
00:12:17,860 --> 00:12:20,080
Not gonna lie, Geolami brings points.

218
00:12:20,380 --> 00:12:21,740
I'm well aware of that!

219
00:12:21,900 --> 00:12:25,900
but I have to find Field, and I
won't give up the search until I do!

220
00:12:28,180 --> 00:12:29,820
