237
00:13:13,293 --> 00:13:14,760
Yes, so am I.

238
00:13:15,120 --> 00:13:16,767
I'll cherish these memories.

239
00:13:19,820 --> 00:13:20,940
It's been fun.

240
00:13:21,680 --> 00:13:22,510
